<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Basic Skills Requirement Evaluation Request</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-row { display: flex; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-row > div { flex: 1; }
  .label { font-weight: normal; }
  .input-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 36pt;">CSUN</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt;">MICHAEL D. EISNER</h2>
    <h3 style="font-size: 12pt;">COLLEGE OF EDUCATION</h3>
    <h3 style="font-size: 12pt;">Credential Office</h3>
  </div>

  <h2 style="margin-top: 40px;">Basic Skills Requirement Evaluation Request</h2>

  <p>Individuals may satisfy the Basic Skills Requirement (BSR) through multiple options. Please review <span data-field="ctc_leaflet_link">{{ ctc_leaflet_link }}</span> for all options for meeting the BSR. If you are choosing an option other than a standardized exam or if you want to combine portions of the exam and coursework you will need to complete this form and submit to the Credential Office for evaluation by email to <span data-field="credential_office_email">{{ credential_office_email }}</span> with subject line "Last Name BSR Evaluation." Please allow 4-6 weeks for processing. Please attach transcript/s for courses you are using to meet BSR.</p>

  <div class="section-title">Student Information</div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 20%;">Name:</div>
    <div style="width: 80%;"><span data-field="full_name" class="input-line">{{ full_name }}</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 20%;">Email:</div>
    <div style="width: 80%;"><span data-field="email" class="input-line">{{ email }}</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 20%;">Credential Program Currently Enrolled</div>
    <div style="width: 80%;"><span data-field="credential_program">{{ credential_program }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;">Check One:</label>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="completed_coursework" style="margin-right: 10px;">
      <label for="completed_coursework">I have completed the following coursework to meet the BSR.</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Courses must meet the following criteria:</div>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li>The course was taken at a regionally accredited college or university</li>
    <li>The course was 3 semester units (or equivalent quarter units)*</li>
    <li>The course was taken for academic credit (earned units)</li>
    <li>The course was passed with a grade of B- or better</li>
    <li>The course was degree applicable (AA coursework included)</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Reading: course must be in critical thinking, literature, philosophy, reading, rhetoric, or textual analysis.**</div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 15%;">Exam</div>
    <div style="width: 25%;">Score:</div>
    <div style="width: 25%;">Course Title:</div>
    <div style="width: 35%;">Date Passed:</div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 15%;">Course Grade:</div>
    <div style="width: 25%;">Term:</div>
    <div style="width: 25%;">Institution:</div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 20px;">Writing: course must be in composition, English, rhetoric, written communication, or writing.**</div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 15%;">Exam</div>
    <div style="width: 25%;">Score:</div>
    <div style="width: 25%;">Course Title:</div>
    <div style="width: 35%;">Date Passed:</div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 15%;">Course Grade:</div>
    <div style="width: 25%;">Term:</div>
    <div style="width: 25%;">Institution:</div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 20px;">Mathematics: course must be in algebra, geometry, mathematics, quantitative reasoning, or statistics.</div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 15%;">Exam</div>
    <div style="width: 25%;">Score:</div>
    <div style="width: 25%;">Course Title:</div>
    <div style="width: 35%;">Date Passed:</div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="width: 15%;">Course Grade:</div>
    <div style="width: 25%;">Term:</div>
    <div style="width: 25%;">Institution:</div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 30px;">* You can use more than one course to meet one content area as long as the total units is 3 or more units.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">** Candidates can use a single course to meet both the reading and writing requirement if they are able to obtain a letter from the English department chair where both courses were taken, that confirms that the single course included significant content in both reading and writing.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">*** Candidates may use a qualifying score from the SAT Evidence-Based Reading & Writing, SAT Critical Reading, ACT English, AP English Language & Composition or English Literature & Composition, or CSU Placement Examinations/ EPT to meet both the reading and writing requirement.</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h3 style="text-align: center;">FOR OFFICE USE ONLY DO NOT WRITE BELOW</h3>
    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <input type="checkbox" id="meets_bsr_option1" style="margin-right: 10px;">
        <label for="meets_bsr_option1">The option above meets BSR, you will be given credit. Your Credential Progress Report will be updated, if applicable.</label>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <input type="checkbox" id="does_not_meet_bsr" style="margin-right: 10px;">
        <label for="does_not_meet_bsr">The option above does not meet BSR. Please review the <span data-field="leaflet_link_office">{{ leaflet_link_office }}</span> for options on how to meet the BSR.</label>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <input type="checkbox" id="additional_info_needed" style="margin-right: 10px;">
        <label for="additional_info_needed">Additional information required to determine verification of BSR.</label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    Comments:
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px; height: 80px;" data-field="field_1">{{ field_1 }}</div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 80px;">
    <div>
      Credential Analyst/Advisor Name:
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px; width: 300px;" data-field="comments">{{ comments }}</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      Signature:
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px; width: 300px;" data-field="credential_analyst_advisor_name">{{ credential_analyst_advisor_name }}</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      Date:
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px; width: 150px;" data-field="signature">{{ signature }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>